This repository contains a QML plugin which provides a convenience
type to allow client applications to easily embed the Sailfish OS
Browser WebView into their own application in order to render web
webcontent.

Applications which use WebView only from QML do not need to link against a
WebEngine library. Applications which use the SailfishOS::WebEngine or
SailfishOS::WebEngineSettings C++ APIs should link against the stable Sailfish
WebEngine library:
CONFIG += link_pkgconfig
PKGCONFIG += sailfishwebengine

Example:

import QtQuick 2.0
import Sailfish.Silica 1.0
import Sailfish.WebView 1.0

ApplicationWindow {
    id: root
    initialPage: Component {
        Page {
            WebView {
                anchors.fill: parent
                url: "http://www.sailfishos.org"
            }
        }
    }
}
